{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zJttSmy0DF1794564406.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>政府上調本港全年經濟預測至增長百分之4.8。</p><p></p><p>第三季本地生產總值，按年升幅加快至百分之5.2，符合市場預期，並較第二季升幅高1個百分點。</p><p></p><p>政府指，考慮到首三季數字及第四季有望進一步增長，全年經濟增長預測，由8月的百分之3.5至4.5，上調至百分之4.8。整體消費物價通脹率預測，由原來百分之2.6下調至百分之2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:27.084461+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:15:24.386840+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:48.937695+00:00","content_hash":"8da818d7f6ae0f9f210403bfea47376a9b5ce3de364e68aefaa7d02054f041ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:27.084461+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}